.git
# Host build artifacts stay out of the context, except the three the runtime
# stage copies in (see docker/Dockerfile): the benchmark binary and the two
# minimal child helpers it spawns.  `build/*` rather than `build/` so the
# exceptions below can re-include files (a file under an excluded parent
# directory cannot be re-included).  Object files stay excluded via *.o.
build/*
*.o
